sgp 2

given
  t = 1
  g1 = curve(y = 1/x)

construct
  point A on g1
    x_A: x(A) = t
  point B on xaxis
  point C on yaxis
  line BC
    A on BC
    BC tan g1

find
  d1: dist(B, C)
  x_B: x(B)

where
  A (1, 1)
  B (2, 1.9193571345323785e-54)
  C (1.9193571345323785e-54, 2)
  x_A label (0.3, 0.3)
  d1 label (0.3, 0.3)
  x_B label (0.3, 0.3)
